<ul>
<li>A part is there only when Console had it: a file saved before Radio Settings was read has no <code>settings.json</code>.</li>
<li>Every part listed in the manifest must be in the zip.</li>
<li>Readers ignore any other entry.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="manifestjson">manifest.json</h2>
